   "evidence": "In a subsingleton semiring, `IsUnit r` holds for every `r`, and `Subsingleton.elim d (monomial 0 1)` gives the right-hand side. The left-hand side `IsUnit (toLaurent d)` also holds because `LaurentRing R K` is then a subsingleton too.",
