   "fix": "Remove `[Nontrivial R]` and begin the proof with `cases subsingleton_or_nontrivial R`, as `isRelPrime_of_isRelPrime_toLaurent` in the same file already does. Then `isRelPrime_of_isRelPrime_toLaurent` can call the iff without a separate case split.",
   "issue": "`MvPolynomial.isUnit_toLaurent_iff` assumes `[Nontrivial R]`, but the statement also holds when `R` is trivial: then every `r` is a unit and `MvPolynomial K R` is a subsingleton, so `d = monomial s r` holds automatically.",
   "line": 0
